diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index fa72497..e7c9e1b 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -17,3 +17,15 @@ make test
 ```
 
 `make test` runs `ansible-lint` and then the molecule scenario.
+
+## Variables
+
+Variables of `nftables_base` (also described in `meta/argument_specs.yml`):
+
+| Variable | Default | Description |
+|----------|---------|-------------|
+| `nftables_base_default_policy` | `drop` | Policy of the input chain: `drop` or `accept`. |
+| `nftables_base_allowed_tcp_ports` | `[22]` | TCP destination ports accepted on the input chain. An empty list adds no port rule. |
+| `nftables_base_ruleset_path` | `/etc/nftables.conf` | File the ruleset is written to and loaded from. |
+
+The ruleset also accepts established and related connections and loopback traffic.
